---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../lib/site';
---

<Base title="Contact" description="Get in touch with Noble Antwi, Cloud Security and Identity Engineer in Chicago. Open to cloud security, IAM, and identity security roles.">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="page-head">
      <span class="kicker">Contact</span>
      <h1 class="display h1">Let's talk.</h1>
      <p class="lead">I work in IT security for the City of Chicago's Department of Aviation and build identity and cloud security labs on the side. Always glad to compare notes with people working on the same problems. Email is the fastest way to reach me; I usually reply within a day.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="contact-grid">
      <a class="contact-card" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}><span class="kicker">Email</span><b>Write to me</b><span>{SITE.email}</span></a>
      <a class="contact-card" href={`https://linkedin.com/in/${SITE.linkedin}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="kicker">LinkedIn</span><b>Connect</b><span>in/{SITE.linkedin}</span></a>
      <a class="contact-card" href={`https://github.com/${SITE.github}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="kicker">GitHub</span><b>Read the code</b><span>@{SITE.github}</span></a>
      <a class="contact-card" href={SITE.medium} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="kicker">Medium</span><b>Longer articles</b><span>@noble-antwi</span></a>
    </div>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="now-grid">
        <div>
          <h3>Good reasons to write</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>You are designing hybrid identity and want a second opinion</li>
            <li>You are building a homelab and hit the wall I hit</li>
            <li>You read a post and think I got something wrong</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Collaboration</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Open-source identity and cloud security tooling</li>
            <li>Lab write-ups and technical writing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Conversation</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Hybrid identity design, homelab builds, the certification path</li>
            <li>If you are earlier on the road, ask. I remember what it was like.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
